			(property "Description" "Stereo audio DAC, 32-bit up to 384kHz, I2S or left-justified (FMT), 112dB SNR, 2.1Vrms ground-centred line outputs (no DC-blocking caps), integrated charge pump and BCK PLL: SCK tied to GND generates the system clock from BCK. 3.3V AVDD/CPVDD, 1.8V or 3.3V DVDD, TSSOP-20, -25 to 85C. Hardware control: FLT, DEMP, FMT, XSMT (high = unmute)"
